# Exception: Ticket 26 restored SPP-Maker-QLIP QLIP_Outputs registry
# (CONSTRAINTS/GUIDANCES/PACKAGES/SPP each have a source-faithful runs/
# subdirectory that must be tracked, including generated registry entries
# Ticket 26 deliberately produces from safe fixture data).
!packages/spp_maker_qlip/QLIP_Outputs/*/runs/
!packages/spp_maker_qlip/QLIP_Outputs/*/runs/**
